*Ammit's summoning commands is "'''Shred them'''".
*Ammit is based off [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ammit#:~:text=Ammit%20(%2F%CB%88%C3%A6m%C9%AA,animals%20known%20to%20ancient%20Egyptians. Ammit], the Devourer of the Dead, who was also a crocodile, that ate hearts of the ones whose hearts were heavier than a feather, which is where the "Heart-Eater" part of the title comes from.

